ry ,the devil who replaced the player go on living in the real world,and the player need to look for Clues to decrypt, eventually escapes the mirror world by breaking down the curse . The real sweet world form a strong contrast with the dark world of mirror, with the gradual decryption of puzzle, a secret also gradually surfaced ... ...", "short_description": "\"Mirror\" is a first-person VR escape game , the player of being cursed and pulled into the mirror\nneed to look for clues to decrypt under the connection of the mirror and the reality ,and ultimately escapes the world in the mirror."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.mq11034182.icoc.me/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://www.mq11034182.icoc.me/", "publisher_name": "21CN - Lucid Dreaming Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.mq11034182.icoc.me/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": null, "genres": ["EXPLORATION", "HORROR", "NARRATIVE", "PUZZLE", "STRATEGY"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "zh_CN"], "supported_input_devices": ["TOUCHPAD", "GEAR_VR_CONTROLLER"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "477129840468723"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12533842_1432199023466025_5991548685807255552_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=q3CCQYZf854Q7kNvwHKzwKd&_nc_oc=Adq9pOOV3qUblsfqRtaeXrc-aBWwI8Lm4xHPevMPPVvBsulXUKPy1YnWcuM3Ooh17to&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLpObWbqN3c5JXMYA6Yh7b7vYKMbXdF1K5p64eZn4eJtA&oe=6AA3F030"}, "is_concept": fal